# SQL Parsing and Generation in Shem

## Parser Architecture
- **Main Parser**: [crates/parser/src/lib.rs](mdc:crates/parser/src/lib.rs) - SQL parsing entry point
- **AST Definition**: [crates/parser/src/ast.rs](mdc:crates/parser/src/ast.rs) - Abstract Syntax Tree structures
- **Visitor Pattern**: [crates/parser/src/visitor.rs](mdc:crates/parser/src/visitor.rs) - AST traversal utilities

## SQL Generation
- **Generator**: [crates/postgres/src/sql_generator.rs](mdc:crates/postgres/src/sql_generator.rs) - SQL output generation
- **Object-Specific**: [crates/postgres/tests/sql_generator/](mdc:crates/postgres/tests/sql_generator/) - Tests for each object type
- **Pattern**: Each PostgreSQL object type has dedicated generation logic

